    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know i should call the doctor but they're closed and i can't even walk to the car right now. it's really bad. i've taken ibuprofen for years and it's always been fine. is there like a small dose i can just take just to get through the night? like like 200mg or something? i don't want to make a big deal out of it if it's not actually dangerous.",
