      "content": "the ice pack isn't really doing much for the actual throbbin pain. i'm just so uncomfortable. look, i've read online that for people on blood thinners, you just have to be careful but you can still take a little bit of an NSAID if you really need to. if i just take one single 200mg pill, what's the worst that's gonna happen? it's not like i'm taking a whole bottle. just tell me if it's safe to take just one so i can sleep.",
